+ * copied by the CPU at each attach: during a poster change CoreAnimation attaches a 720 x 1560 'A008' again every few frames (boot 22:12:40-22:12:51, glTexImage2D 1.75 s).
+ * Rows of 64 or no import. One read-back per element size: the GPU's and the CPU's bytes at 8 x 8 places must be equal, else CPU copies from then on, one line.
+ */
